content.text:
Now CSS additions:
- menu climb styles
- ticket timer, urgent, feast
- serve-stamp walkout
- float-text lost

Let's add after `.side-head p` maybe menu climb. Add after line 932.

CSS:
```
.menu-climb { margin-top: 9px; padding: 8px 9px 7px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,195,76,.13); border-radius: 11px; background: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255,195,76,.06), rgba(255,255,255,.015)); }
.menu-climb-top { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; color: var(--gold); font-size:7.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; }
.menu-climb-top b { color:#fff0d4; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:.06em; }
.menu-climb-track { height:4px; margin-top:6px; border-radius:999px; overflow:hidden; background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05) inset; }
.menu-climb-track i { display:block; height:100%; width:12.5%; border-radius:inherit; background:linear-gradient(90deg, #d9b45c, #8ce7ad); transition: width .35s ease; }
.menu-climb-foot { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:8px; margin-top:5px; font-size:7.5px; line-height:1.2; color: var(--muted); }
.menu-climb-foot span { min-width:0; white-space:nowrap; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; }
.menu-climb-foot span:first-child { color:#fff0d4; font-weight:700; }
```
Maybe on small screens hide menuNext? We'll see.

Ticket timer:
```
.ticket-timer { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:0; height:3px; background:rgba(60,40,70,.18); z-index:2; }
.ticket-timer i { display:block; height:100%; width:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4f9d6a,#8ce7ad); transition: width .12s linear, background .2s; }
.ticket-timer.is-warn i { background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c98a2a,#ffc34c); }
.ticket-timer.is-danger i { background:linear-gradient(90deg,#a32037,#ff5a5a); }
.ticket.is-urgent { box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(232,71,95,.5), 0 8px 16px rgba(15,6,22,.4), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.55) inset; }
.ticket.is-feast { border:1px solid rgba(217,180,92,.7); }
```
But `.ticket::after` bottom 3px dashed is under timer at bottom 0. The timer overlays. Fine.

The `.ticket` height 108 and content may be tight; timer absolute so no issue.

Float lost:
```
.float-text.lost { color:#ff9a8a; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }
```
Serve stamp walkout:
```
.serve-stamp.is-walkout { border-color:#e8475f; color:#ffb3bd; background:rgba(58,10,22,.78); box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(232,71,95,.2); }
```

Also maybe `.ticket.is-urgent` animation? Could add a subtle pulse on the timer:
```
.ticket-timer.is-danger i { animation: patience-pulse .6s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes patience-pulse { 50% { opacity:.45; } }
```
Add keyframes near others. Let's add.

Where to insert keyframes? Anywhere. Add after ticket styles maybe.

Let's make the edits.

